sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kubelet / CRI
    participant N as netd
    participant M as manager
    participant Q as QEMU / guest
    K->>K: Replace sandbox, keep API Pod UID
    Note over K,N: Namespace A and namespace B are different resources
    N->>N: Invalidate old ready context
    N->>N: Hold / verify B, apply network plan
    N->>N: Retire old worker and bind current DHCP
    M->>N: Probe own NIC
    N-->>M: New opaque Pod + namespace token
    M->>Q: device_del
    Q-->>M: Guest releases device, removal confirmed
    M->>Q: netdev_del releases old queues
    M->>N: Request new queues
    N-->>M: SCM_RIGHTS from held namespace B
    M->>Q: getfd, netdev_add, device_add
    Note over M,Q: Same VM identity, configured MAC and root port
